{"id":"2e72efb02984d69c","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-sacks-minimal.md","title":"0′ 以下的极小度","display":"thm-sacks-minimal — 0′ 以下的极小度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-sacks-minimal","aliases":["20-thm-sacks-minimal"],"display":"thm-sacks-minimal — 0′ 以下的极小度","chapter":"13","section":"13.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"source-verified","source_reference":"Theorem 13.1.1","source_pdf_pages":[233,234,235,236,237],"source_printed_pages":[203,204,205,206,207],"depends_on":["[[20-df-minimal]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-splitting-procedure]]","[[20-lem-black-node-oracle-test]]","[[20-lem-finite-tree-switches]]","[[20-lem-minimality-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-sacks-minimal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-sacks-minimal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sacks-minimal — 0′ 以下的极小度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"13"},{"key":"section","html":"13.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-verified"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 13.1.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>233</span><span>234</span><span>235</span><span>236</span><span>237</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>203</span><span>204</span><span>205</span><span>206</span><span>207</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" href=\"?note=b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" title=\"20-df-minimal\">20-df-minimal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"94da30522fe93e7f\" href=\"?note=94da30522fe93e7f\" title=\"20-df-splitting-procedure\">20-df-splitting-procedure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"05d82ffd170fb7a6\" href=\"?note=05d82ffd170fb7a6\" title=\"20-lem-black-node-oracle-test\">20-lem-black-node-oracle-test</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ec513c4de458d45\" href=\"?note=2ec513c4de458d45\" title=\"20-lem-finite-tree-switches\">20-lem-finite-tree-switches</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"42322b2e4562a7f4\" href=\"?note=42322b2e4562a7f4\" title=\"20-lem-minimality-tree\">20-lem-minimality-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span> 为一次跳跃度。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" href=\"?note=b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" title=\"20-df-minimal\">20-df-minimal</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"94da30522fe93e7f\" href=\"?note=94da30522fe93e7f\" title=\"20-df-splitting-procedure\">20-df-splitting-procedure</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"05d82ffd170fb7a6\" href=\"?note=05d82ffd170fb7a6\" title=\"20-lem-black-node-oracle-test\">20-lem-black-node-oracle-test</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2ec513c4de458d45\" href=\"?note=2ec513c4de458d45\" title=\"20-lem-finite-tree-switches\">20-lem-finite-tree-switches</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"42322b2e4562a7f4\" href=\"?note=42322b2e4562a7f4\" title=\"20-lem-minimality-tree\">20-lem-minimality-tree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}minimal}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\ [\\operatorname{Minimal}(\\mathbf a)\\land\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf0&#39;].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sacks\\text{-}minimal}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a\\ [\\operatorname{Minimal}(\\mathbf a)\\land\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf0&#39;].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此构造不能直接把 Spector 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\\)</span> 判断换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。原书通过部分函数树和回溯处理潜在黑节点，逐个需求证明最终树及路径稳定。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 13.1.1；印刷页 203, 204, 205, 206, 207；PDF 第 233, 234, 235, 236, 237 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n<p>续修说明：第 13.4 节的关键输入是部分树程序的完整索引：检测的是该程序未来全部可能值的分裂，不是当前有限枚举前沿。固定父树程序后，策略只有一次白到黑反向；父策略改变则重置。上游最终稳定后，每层得到全黑树或全白树，并保持路径条件，黑白需求极小性引理再给非零极小度。逐阶段完整构造以原书 §§13.2–13.6 为来源，此处不把有限重置计数单独当作全构造验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-minimal","status":"resolved","id":"b8c49b6cb74c57b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-minimal]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-splitting-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"94da30522fe93e7f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-splitting-procedure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-black-node-oracle-test","status":"resolved","id":"05d82ffd170fb7a6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":